<title>CHINA: China fixed asset investment to be stable in 1997.</title>
<headline>China fixed asset investment to be stable in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's fixed asset investment is expected to be 2.8 trillion yuan in 1997, an increase of 18.6 percent from this year and about the same growth rate as in 1996, the China Securities News said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The growth in investment in the state sector will be slower than for collective and private firms, the newspaper quoted a report by the State Information Centre as saying.</p>
</text>
